# Whitelist: the build sees only what the agent image is built from. Later lines win.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src
!src/oumi_weights_lab
!src/oumi_weights_lab/**
!docker
!docker/proving-ground-stub.md
!skills
!skills/oumi-weights-lab
!skills/oumi-weights-lab/**
